### Requisições prontas para a extensão REST Client (VS Code) ou o cliente HTTP do IntelliJ.
### A mesma API está documentada em http://localhost:3000/docs
@api = http://localhost:3000
@document = 52998224725

### Saúde
GET {{api}}/health

### Cadastrar cliente pré-pago
# @name client
POST {{api}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "documentId": "529.982.247-25", "documentType": "CPF", "planType": "prepaid", "balance": 10 }

### Cadastrar cliente pós-pago
POST {{api}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Loja", "documentId": "11.222.333/0001-81", "documentType": "CNPJ", "planType": "postpaid", "limit": 50 }

### Autenticar (devolve o token)
# @name auth
POST {{api}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentId": "{{document}}", "documentType": "CPF" }

### Saldo
GET {{api}}/clients/{{client.response.body.id}}/balance

### Adicionar créditos
POST {{api}}/clients/{{client.response.body.id}}/credits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 5.5 }

### Extrato
GET {{api}}/clients/{{client.response.body.id}}/transactions

### Enviar mensagem urgente (com o token)
# @name message
POST {{api}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth.response.body.token}}

{ "recipientId": "dest-1", "recipientName": "Destinatário", "content": "Olá!", "priority": "urgent" }

### Enviar mensagem normal (identificando pelo documento)
POST {{api}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Document: {{document}}

{ "recipientId": "dest-1", "content": "Sem pressa" }

### Status e histórico da mensagem
GET {{api}}/messages/{{message.response.body.id}}/status
X-Client-Document: {{document}}

### Marcar como lida
PATCH {{api}}/messages/{{message.response.body.id}}/read
X-Client-Document: {{document}}

### Mensagens (filtros: status, priority, conversationId)
GET {{api}}/messages?priority=urgent
X-Client-Document: {{document}}

### Conversas
GET {{api}}/conversations
X-Client-Document: {{document}}

### Estado da fila
GET {{api}}/queue/status
